- `{{ t.gcp_name }}`: message ordering enabled; dedup on `(topic, {{ t.dedup_scope | default(value="orderingKey") }}, {{ t.dedup }})` (arcus-fnox `{{ t.twin_surface | default(value="/pubsub/") }}`).
{% endfor %}
## Push subscription (OIDC)
{% for p in pushes %}
- `{{ p.gcp_name }}` -> `{{ p.endpoint }}` (audience `{{ p.audience }}`, signer `{{ p.signer }}`, issuer `{{ p.issuer | default(value="https://accounts.google.com") }}`, alg `{{ p.alg | default(value="RS256") }}`, JWKS `{{ p.twin_surface | default(value="/oidc/") }}{{ p.jwks_path | default(value="/.well-known/jwks.json") | trim_start_matches(pat="/") }}`).
{% endfor %}
