## Gates (any row = refusal)

- `gates/010_topic_dedup.rq` — topic without ordering or without `durable_intent_token` dedup.
- `gates/020_worker_single_secret.rq` — egress worker with secret cardinality != 1.
- `gates/030_zero_static_key.rq` — any `google_service_account_key` / `fgb:StaticKey`.
- `gates/040_push_oidc.rq` — push without OIDC/https/topic; service without runtime SA; bucket without intake trigger.
